cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use or cite this project, please use the metadata below."
title: "Bayonetta 3 Recomp"
type: software
version: "0.1.0"
date-released: "2026-11-08"
url: "https://github.com/aoxzh/bayo3-recomp"
repository-code: "https://github.com/aoxzh/bayo3-recomp"
license: "GPL-3.0-or-later"
abstract: >-
  Bayonetta 3 Recomp is an open-source static recompiler and
  Horizon/NVN Vulkan runtime that runs Bayonetta 3 for Nintendo Switch version
  1.2.0 natively on Windows, Linux / Steam Deck and Android. It is not an
  emulator and does not include game files.
keywords:
  - Bayonetta 3
  - static recompilation
  - recompiler
  - Vulkan
  - NVN
  - Nintendo Switch
  - Windows
  - Linux
  - Steam Deck
  - Android
authors:
  - name: "Bayonetta 3 Recomp contributors"
